00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:21.854
And the idea is,
I'm going to throw plates

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.524
and whoever breaks them,
first one to three wins.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.159
So it's a famous quarterback,
Drew Brees, to the Saints...

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.095
-He's alright.
-...and Taylor.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.297
So Taylor goes first,
pressure's on him.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.431
I throw the plate.

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:34.300
You break
the plate immediately.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.835
Great. Drew's turn.
I throw the plate.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.204
He misses the plate.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.772
Second plate,
I throw it for you.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.474
You hit it immediately.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.476
Drew Brees stops laughing.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.379
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.514
You've never seen anyone
switch it on.

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:49.915
-He changed.
-I'll never forget it.

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:51.651
He was like -- [ Laughs ]

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.819
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:54.954
And then at one point,

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.255
I couldn't even
let go of the plate.

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:57.523
-Yeah.
-I go, "Just stop.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:58.925
I just don't want to play
the game anymore."

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.194
He was like someone
throwing something at me.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.095
I was like -- And he, like,
ended up winning.

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:05.498
But it was like an athlete
just turning it on.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.366
But I'll never forget.
That was such a fun moment.

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:08.301
-So fun.

